Package: mediaplanr.viz
Title: Web Visualizations for Media Plans
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Ben Denis", "Shaffer", , "my.blogdown@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Chart specifications for mediaplanr objects. Every function
    builds a plain list -- an Apache ECharts option -- from one of the
    projections mediaplanr exports, so the same output renders in Shiny,
    in a notebook, or in any frontend that speaks JSON.
